<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal retail sales fell 3.7 pct mth/mth June.</title>
<headline>Portugal retail sales fell 3.7 pct mth/mth June.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portugal's retail sales index fell 3.7 percent in June from May, but retail sales were 1.9 percent up on June last year, the National Statistics Institute (INE) said.</p>
<p>INE gave the following figures for retail sales:</p>
<p>				     June 96	 May 96	June 95</p>
<p>    Index (base 1990)	   138.1	  143.4	  135.6</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom +(351-1) 3538254</p>
</text>
